ocd|n|Collectively, the people of England; English people or persons. ; The language of England or of the English nation, and of their descendants in America, India, and other countries. ; A kind of printing type, in size between Pica and Great Primer. See Type. ; A twist or spinning motion given to a ball in striking it that influences the direction it will take after touching a cushion or another ball.	a:1bxk,101,2;60f,56,3~60f,56,3;1bxk,101,2
